#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/wizards/recover_order_wizard.py:0
msgid "The Amazon order reference must be in 3-7-7 format."
msgstr "ລະຫັດອ້າງອີງລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ Amazon ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ 3-7-7."

#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/models/amazon_account.py:0
msgid ""
"The Amazon order with reference %(ref)s was not recovered because its "
"currency was missing from the Amazon order data."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ Amazon ທີ່ມີລະຫັດອ້າງອີງ %(ref)s ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການກູ້ຄືນ ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນສະກຸນເງິນຈາກຂໍ້ມູນລາຍ"
"ການສັ່ງຊື້ຂອງ Amazon."

#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/models/amazon_account.py:0
msgid ""
"The Amazon order with reference %(ref)s was not recovered because its status "
"(%(status)s) is not eligible for synchronization for its fulfillment channel "
"(%(channel)s)."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ Amazon ທີ່ມີລະຫັດອ້າງອີງ %(ref)s ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການກູ້ຄືນ ເນື່ອງຈາກສະຖານະ (%(status)s) ບໍ່"
"ກົງຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ຈະຊິ້ງຄ໌ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງການຈັດສົ່ງ (%(channel)s)."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_marketplace__region
msgid ""
"The Amazon region of the marketplace. Please refer to the Selling Partner "
"API documentation to find the correct region."
msgstr ""
"ພາກພື້ນ Amazon ຂອງຕະຫຼາດກາງ. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງເອກະສານຄູ່ມື Selling Partner API ເພື່ອຊອກຫາພາກພື້ນ"
"ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_sale_order_line__amazon_item_ref
msgid "The Amazon-defined item reference."
msgstr "ລະຫັດອ້າງອີງລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ Amazon."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_marketplace__api_ref
msgid "The Amazon-defined marketplace reference."
msgstr "ລະຫັດອ້າງອີງຕະຫຼາດກາງທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ Amazon."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_sale_order__amazon_order_ref
msgid "The Amazon-defined order reference."
msgstr "ລະຫັດອ້າງອີງລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ Amazon."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__team_id
msgid "The Sales Team assigned to Amazon orders for reporting"
msgstr "ທີມງານຂາຍທີ່ຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ Amazon ສຳລັບການລາຍງານ"

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_offer__sku
msgid "The Stock Keeping Unit."
msgstr "ລະຫັດສິນຄ້າ (Stock Keeping Unit)."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_offer__amazon_channel
msgid ""
"The channel will be updated with the incomming orders or, if left empty, "
"during the next stock synchronization."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງທາງຈະຖືກອັບເດດພ້ອມກັບລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ ຫຼື ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້ ຈະອັບເດດໃນລະຫວ່າງການຊິ້ງຄ໌ສິນຄ້າໃນສ"
"າງຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/utils.py:0
msgid "The communication with the API failed."
msgstr "ການສື່ສານກັບ API ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/utils.py:0
msgid ""
"The communication with the API failed.\n"
"Error code: %(error_code)s; description: %(error_message)s"
msgstr ""
"ການສື່ສານກັບ API ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ລະຫັດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: %(error_code)s; ລາຍລະອຽດ: %(error_message)s"

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__base_marketplace_id
msgid "The home marketplace of this account; used for authentication only."
msgstr "ຕະຫຼາດກາງຫຼັກຂອງບັນຊີນີ້ນ; ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__last_orders_sync
msgid ""
"The last synchronization date for orders placed on this account. Orders "
"whose status has not changed since this date will not be created nor updated "
"in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີຊິ້ງຄ໌ຫຼ້າສຸດສຳລັບລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ໃນບັນຊີນີ້ນ. ລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ທີ່ສະຖານະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຕັ້ງແຕ່ວັນທີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງ "
"ຫຼື ອັບເດດໃນ Odoo."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__location_id
msgid ""
"The location of the stock managed by Amazon under the Amazon Fulfillment "
"program."
msgstr "ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບສິນຄ້າທີ່ຄຸ້ມຄອງໂດຍ Amazon ພາຍໃຕ້ໂຄງການ Amazon Fulfillment."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__refresh_token
msgid "The long-lived token that can be exchanged for a new access token."
msgstr "ໂທເຄັນໄລຍະຍາວທີ່ສາມາດນຳໄປແລກປ່ຽນເປັນ access token ໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_offer__marketplace_id
msgid "The marketplace of this offer."
msgstr "ຕະຫຼາດກາງຂອງຂໍ້ສະເໜີນີ້ນ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__available_marketplace_ids
msgid "The marketplaces this account has access to."
msgstr "ຕະຫຼາດກາງທີ່ບັນຊີນີ້ນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__active_marketplace_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_offer__active_marketplace_ids
msgid "The marketplaces this account sells on."
msgstr "ຕະຫຼາດກາງທີ່ບັນຊີນີ້ນຂາຍສິນຄ້າຢູ່."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__restricted_data_token_expiry
msgid "The moment at which the Restricted Data Token becomes invalid."
msgstr "ເວລາທີ່ Restricted Data Token ໝົດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__access_token_expiry
msgid "The moment at which the token becomes invalid."
msgstr "ເວລາທີ່ໂທເຄັນໝົດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"The order has been cancelled by the Amazon customer while someproducts have "
"already been delivered. Please create a return for this order to adjust the "
"stock."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ຖືກຍົກເລີກໂດຍລູກຄ້າ Amazon ໃນຂະນະທີ່ສິນຄ້າບາງລາຍການໄດ້ຖືກຈັດສົ່ງແລ້ວ. ກະລຸນາສ້າງການສົ່ງ"
"ຄືນສຳລັບລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ດັ່ງກ່າວເພື່ອປັບຍອດສິນຄ້າໃນສາງ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/models/amazon_account.py:0
msgid "The order was not found on this account's marketplaces."
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ໃນຕະຫຼາດກາງຂອງບັນຊີນີ້ນ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/models/amazon_account.py:0
msgid "The provided reference does not match any Amazon order."
msgstr "ລະຫັດອ້າງອີງທີ່ລະບຸບໍ່ກົງກັບລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ Amazon ໃດເລີຍ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_recover_order_wizard__amazon_order_ref
msgid "The reference to the Amazon order to recover, in 3-7-7 format"
msgstr "ລະຫັດອ້າງອີງລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ Amazon ທີ່ຈະກູ້ຄືນ, ໃນຮູບແບບ 3-7-7"

#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/models/stock_picking.py:0
msgid ""
"The sales order of this delivery order is not linked to an Amazon account."
msgstr "ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍຂອງລາຍການຈັດສົ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບບັນຊີ Amazon."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_offer__account_id
msgid "The seller account used to manage this product."
msgstr "ບັນຊີຜູ້ຂາຍທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຈັດການສິນຄ້ານີ້."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__restricted_data_token
msgid ""
"The short-lived token used instead of the LWA Access Token to access "
"restricted data"
msgstr ""
"ໂທເຄັນໄລຍະສັ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນ LWA Access Token ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ"

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__access_token
msgid "The short-lived token used to query Amazon API on behalf of a seller."
msgstr "ໂທເຄັນໄລຍະສັ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສອບຖາມ Amazon API ໃນນາມຂອງຜູ້ຂາຍ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_stock_picking__amazon_sync_status
msgid ""
"The synchronization status of the delivery order to Amazon:\n"
"- Pending: The delivery order has been confirmed and will soon be "
"synchronized.\n"
"- Processing: The delivery details have been sent and are being processed.\n"
"- Done: The delivery details have been processed.\n"
"- Error: The synchronization of the delivery order failed."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານະການຊິ້ງຄ໌ລາຍການຈັດສົ່ງສິນຄ້າໄປຍັງ Amazon:\n"
"- ລໍຖ້າດຳເນີນການ: ລາຍການຈັດສົ່ງສິນຄ້າໄດ້ຮັບການຢັ້ງຢືນແລ້ວ ແລະ ຈະຖືກຊິ້ງຄ໌ໃນໄວໆນີ້.\n"
"- ກຳລັງດຳເນີນການ: ລາຍລະອຽດການຈັດສົ່ງໄດ້ຖືກສົ່ງແລ້ວ ແລະ ກຳລັງຖືກປະມວນຜົນ.\n"
"- ສຳເລັດ: ລາຍລະອຽດການຈັດສົ່ງໄດ້ຮັບການປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ.\n"
"- ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ການຊິ້ງຄ໌ລາຍການຈັດສົ່ງສິນຄ້າບໍ່ສຳເລັດ."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_offer__amazon_sync_status
msgid ""
"The synchronization status of the product's stock level to Amazon:\n"
"- Processing: The stock level has been sent and is being processed.\n"
"- Done: The stock level has been processed.\n"
"- Error: The synchronization of the stock level failed.\n"
"- Reset: The next stock synchronization will reset the FBM stock level to 0."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານະການຊິ້ງຄ໌ລະດັບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງໄປຍັງ Amazon:\n"
"- ກຳລັງດຳເນີນການ: ລະດັບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງໄດ້ຖືກສົ່ງແລ້ວ ແລະ ກຳລັງຖືກປະມວນຜົນ.\n"
"- ສຳເລັດ: ລະດັບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງໄດ້ຮັບການປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ.\n"
"- ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ການຊິ້ງຄ໌ລະດັບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງບໍ່ສຳເລັດ.\n"
"- ຣີເຊັດ: ການຊິ້ງຄ໌ສິນຄ້າໃນສາງຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຈະຣີເຊັດລະດັບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງ FBM ເປັນ 0."

#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/models/amazon_account.py:0
msgid ""
"The synchronization with Amazon failed. Amazon gave us this information "
"about the problem:"
msgstr "ການຊິ້ງຄ໌ກັບ Amazon ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. Amazon ໄດ້ແຈ້ງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_amazon.field_amazon_account__name
msgid "The user-defined name of the account."
msgstr "ຊື່ບັນຊີທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:sale_amazon.constraint_amazon_marketplace_unique_api_ref
msgid "There can only exist one marketplace for a given API Identifier."
msgstr "ສາມາດມີຕະຫຼາດກາງໄດ້ພຽງໜຶ່ງດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນສຳລັບລະຫັດລະບຸ API ນີ້."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:sale_amazon.constraint_sale_order_unique_amazon_order_ref
msgid "There can only exist one sale order for a given Amazon Order Reference."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດມີໃບສັ່ງຂາຍໄດ້ພຽງໜຶ່ງດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນສຳລັບລະຫັດອ້າງອີງລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ Amazon ນີ້."

#. module: sale_amazon
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:sale_amazon.constraint_sale_order_line_unique_amazon_item_ref
msgid ""
"There can only exist one sale order line for a given Amazon Item Reference."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດມີລາຍການໃບສັ່ງຂາຍໄດ້ພຽງແຖວດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນສຳລັບລະຫັດອ້າງອີງລາຍການ Amazon ນີ້."

#. module: sale_amazon
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_amazon/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid ""
"This Amazon partner was created with an invalid state (%s); please set the "
